+/*
+ * BCM2838 Gigabit Ethernet emulation
+ *
+ * Copyright (C) 2022 Ovchinnikov Vitalii <vitalii.ovchinnikov@auriga.com>
+ *
+ * SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
